      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In the early 1880s, Colorado City served as a cattle shipment hub, driving herds there before loading them onto trains for eastern markets.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        25
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Colorado_City%2C_Texas",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "By 1910, Colorado City boasted a new public school, waterworks, and an electric plant, signaling rapid modernization.",
